      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Steven Moreland, I have some question about using extension interface.\nHal extension interface could let me add some customized function elegantly.\nBut, it still has to add some intermediate interface in VibratorService because only\nsystem_server has ability to access vendor_service.\n\nHow could I provided hal extension interface to our app without any modify on framework?\nIf extension interface is only to accessed by system_server, then what should i do to extends framework api elegantly?\n\nIf we must modify framework api, what is the mean of hal extension?",
